## Existing Tech Stack
- **Dispatch tool:** Custom Rails 5 app, internally maintained by 2 engineers
- **CRM:** Salesforce (Sales Cloud)
- **TMS (Transportation Management System):** Currently evaluating vendors. No selection made.
- **Driver mobile app:** Custom React Native app, last major update in 2023
- **Accounting:** NetSuite
- **Data warehouse:** None (BI is run out of Excel exports from Salesforce)

## Background Notes
- Northwind grew 40% in 2024 by acquiring two smaller brokerages. Tech integration from those acquisitions is incomplete.
- Sarah has asked us specifically because we did similar work for a peer brokerage (Cascade Freight) in 2024.
- This is a competitive engagement — they are also talking to two other firms.


